== Effects ==
* Doubles Isaac's {{e|Penny|text=pennies}}.
* If Isaac has no pennies, gives 2 pennies instead.

== Strategy ==
* The penny counter cannot exceed 99, so the most optimal time to use '''2 of Diamonds''' is when Isaac has 49 or 50 pennies.
* {{dlc+|a}} {{mode|greed}} '''2 of Diamonds''' is an excellent way of filling up the {{m|Greed Donation Machine}}:
** It can be used if Isaac has few coins left after defeating {{e|Ultra Greed}}.
** If Isaac has many coins, they can be donated until 49 or 50 coins are left and then doubled for a total of donated coins exceeding 99 coins.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|nr}}: Quadruples Isaac's pennies.
* {{i|Deep Pockets|r}}: Allows for enormous wealth to be accumulated, as the coin limit is increased to 999.
* {{c|Keeper}} / {{c|Tainted Keeper|r}}: Can refill coin health at the cost of 1 coin after doubling.

== Interactions ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth|r}}: No effect.
* {{a|It's the Key}}: Acquiring pennies with '''2 of Diamonds''' does not invalidate the achievement condition.

